 Recorded incremental demo. Start from identified plain llama.cpp cf34d3113 (owned checkout,         
 branch `demo-incremental-3`) and the frozen fast contract qwen36-quick-v1. Use                      
 engine.expert_streaming as your engineering method: read its guide and the current evidence, then   
 make one meaningful behavioural change at a time. For every decision write the mechanism            
